---
source: tests/document_formats_test.rs
expression: "render(\"typst\")"
---
#set page(paper: "a4", margin: (left: 2.5cm, right: 2.5cm, top: 2.5cm, bottom: 2.5cm))

#set text(size: 11pt)

// Define colors for recipe elements
#let ingredientcolor = rgb(204, 85, 0)
#let cookwarecolor = rgb(34, 139, 34)
#let timercolor = rgb(220, 20, 60)

// Custom commands for recipe elements
#let ingredient(ingredient) = { text(fill: ingredientcolor)[*#ingredient*] }
#let cookware(cookware) = { text(fill: cookwarecolor)[*#cookware*] }
#let timer(timer) = { text(fill: timercolor)[*#timer*] }

// BEGIN_RECIPE_CONTENT

// BEGIN_TITLE
#set align(center)
= Test Kitchen
#set align(left)
#v(0.5cm)
// END_TITLE

// TAGS: dinner
*Tags:* `dinner`

// SERVINGS: 4
// BEGIN_METADATA
#set align(center)
Servings: 4
#set align(left)
// END_METADATA

== Ingredients

- *200 g* #ingredient("plain flour")
- *250 ml* #ingredient("whole milk")
- #ingredient("fine sea salt")
- #ingredient("sauce") _(see recipe: ./sauce)_
- *1 tbsp* #ingredient("icing sugar") --- sifted

== Cookware

- #cookware("large mixing bowl")
- *2* #cookware("pan")

== Instructions

=== Section 1

+ Mix #ingredient("plain flour") with #ingredient("whole milk") in a #cookware("large mixing bowl") and beat until smooth, then add #ingredient("fine sea salt").
+ Simmer #timer("gently: 10 minutes") in a #cookware("pan"), then rest #timer("5 minutes").

_Note: Rest the dough somewhere warm, covered._


=== Finishing

+ Serve with #ingredient("sauce") and dust with #ingredient("icing sugar").

// END_RECIPE_CONTENT

#v(1fr)
#set align(center)
#set text(10pt)
_Created with CookCLI_
